<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Adore You - Acoustic</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Bryant Barnes</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Adore You (Acoustic)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0JTjvbwGOoo7YIWlaAs03u</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.080" end="00:03.440">Is it true?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.440" end="00:06.520">Are you getting sick of me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.520" end="00:09.720">All I want to do is adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.720" end="00:12.780">All I want to do is adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.780" end="00:15.970">Tell the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.970" end="00:18.850">Are you going to lie to me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.850" end="00:22.160">If all I want to do is adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.160" end="00:26.850">Adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.850" end="00:29.940">I've been thinking back like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.940" end="00:33.000">Where did we go wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.000" end="00:36.160">Been here for so long, I don't know?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.160" end="00:38.810">How did we get like this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.810" end="00:41.670">Maybe I got too attached</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.670" end="00:45.530">I never had a choice, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.530" end="00:48.680">Hear it in your voice on the phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.680" end="00:50.910">Wish I had you right here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.910" end="00:54.940">You're going to me make me hate if I'm right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.940" end="00:59.120">Is there somebody else?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.120" end="01:01.910">Don't want nobody else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.910" end="01:03.410">So baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.560" end="01:05.760">Is it true?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.760" end="01:07.850">Are you getting sick of me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.850" end="01:11.010">All I want to do is adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.010" end="01:15.070">All I want to do is adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.070" end="01:17.220">Tell the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.220" end="01:20.190">Are you going lie to me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.190" end="01:24.130">If all I want to do is adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.130" end="01:28.720">Adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.720" end="01:33.070">Thought I was used to this</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.070" end="01:35.990">But you're the exception</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.990" end="01:39.200">Get all insecure and shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.200" end="01:41.010">When I'm all alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.010" end="01:43.920">(Adore you) And how can I love you when</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.920" end="01:47.820">(Adore you) I never know what's going on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.820" end="01:52.100">(Adore you) Is all the feeling gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.100" end="01:54.590">Is it true?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.590" end="01:58.760">Are you getting sick of me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.760" end="02:02.260">All I want to do is adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.260" end="02:04.840">All I want to do is adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.840" end="02:08.110">Tell the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.110" end="02:11.070">Are you going lie to me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.070" end="02:14.010">If all I want to do is adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.010" end="02:18.820">Adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.820" end="02:21.840">Adore you oh, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.840" end="02:24.940">Adore you, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.940" end="02:27.810">Adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.810" end="02:29.310">Adore you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.130" end="02:33.130" /></div></body></tt>